  "id": "moog-sirin",
  "name": "Moog Sirin",
  "manufacturer": "Moog",
  "family": "Sirin",
  "status": "experimental",
  "trust": "local",
  "description": "Moog Sirin analog synthesizer module: the MIDI CC table of its manual, with the LFO clock divider table it points to.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "Sirin User Manual v2.1",
      "notes": "MIDI CC table (pages 26, 27) read by tools/profiles/moog/read-moog-pdf.mjs from Sirin_Manual_2_1.pdf (sha256 8e5f625db4a4892e56a93269ee4e3d417bbae6df56bcc542e0fb3cdd8192cb9c), https://cdn.inmusicbrands.com/Moog/Sirin/Sirin_Manual_2_1.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/moog/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/moog/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI tables, with its printed name. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "No identity check: the manual prints no Device Inquiry reply.",
    "19 knob(s) are printed as an MSB and an LSB, 0 - 16383 together; CEditor sends the MSB alone, 0 - 127, which the manual says the instrument takes by itself: LFO RATE (CC 3, LSB 35); LFO VCO AMOUNT (CC 13, LSB 45); LFO VCF AMOUNT (CC 12, LSB 44); VCO 2 FREQ (CC 17, LSB 49); VCO 2 BEAT (CC 18, LSB 50); VCO 1 (CC 15, LSB 47); VCO 2 (CC 16, LSB 48); EXTERNAL IN LEVEL (CC 27, LSB 59); CUTOFF (CC 19, LSB 51); RESONANCE (CC 21, LSB 53); EG AMOUNT (CC 22, LSB 50); FILTER KB TRACK (CC 20, LSB 54); VCF ATTACK (CC 23, LSB 55); VCF DECAY/ RELEASE (CC 24, LSB 56); VCF SUSTAIN (CC 25, LSB 57); VCA ATTACK (CC 28, LSB 60); VCA DECAY/ RELEASE (CC 29, LSB 61); VCA SUSTAIN (CC 30, LSB 62); VCA (OUTPUT) LEVEL (CC 7, LSB 39).",
    "Left out, MIDI's own controller (a channel mode message), not a setting: LOCAL CONTROL OFF (CC 122), ALL SOUNDS OFF (CC 120), ALL NOTES OFF (CC 123).",
    "Left out, printed without a range: MOD WHEEL (CC 1(MSB) 33(LSB)): -."
  ],
